sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant U as User
    participant API as Control API
    participant DB as PostgreSQL
    participant OB as Outbox
    participant ST as Starter/Scheduler
    participant TP as Temporal

    U->>API: POST /tasks + Idempotency-Key
    API->>DB: verify account/tenant membership
    API->>DB: INSERT task (idempotent)
    API->>DB: ensure slots 1..3
    API->>DB: claim free slot FOR UPDATE SKIP LOCKED
    alt slot and all quota gates pass
        DB-->>API: slot_no + lease_generation
        API->>DB: state=ADMITTED + outbox event
        API-->>U: 202 ADMITTED
        OB-->>ST: TaskAdmitted
        ST->>TP: Update-with-Start / idempotent workflow ID
    else no slot or lower-level gate blocks
        API->>DB: state=WAITING_FOR_SLOT + reason
        API-->>U: 202 WAITING_FOR_SLOT + queue position
    end
